# Abundance and a Words of Wind effect, both Bot1's, both replace its draws, and Bot1 orders them (CR 616.1). Bot1 declines
# Abundance for its turn 3 draw for the turn and draws Ancestral Recall; then it activates Words of Wind once and casts the
# spell. For the first draw it has Abundance apply first and takes it, choosing land: the Island on top goes to its hand -
# not a draw, so the Words effect is not used. For the second it has the Words effect apply: each player returns a
# permanent, Bot1 its Mox Jet and Bot2 its Swamp, and the effect is used up. The third meets Abundance alone, which Bot1
# declines, and draws the Plains.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Abundance
Words of Wind
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ancestral Recall
Island
Plains
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

